  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"扩展科技\"></p>\n<h3>扩展科技是一款为 Create 模组添加新特性的附加模组！</h3>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Architectury API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.19.2.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>本模组新增：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>铁路道口信号灯</li>\n<li><em>如果您有任何建议，请提交<a href=\"https://github.com/TeamDiopside/ExpandingTechnologies/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">建议表单</a></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f8C3wTDdiaV4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/videoplayer.png\" alt=\"铁路道口信号灯\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamdiopside.nl%252fdiscord%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
